# Feature: [name]

## Goal

Describe the user or system outcome.

## Requirements

- Describe observable behavior and constraints.
- For an API, specify endpoints, inputs, outputs, status codes and errors.
- Describe authorization, persistence, transactions and data lifecycle where
  relevant. Do not infer business decisions from an entity diagram.

## Data model

Describe entities and relationships here. A Mermaid `erDiagram` can be included
when useful; explain constraints and behavior not expressible in the diagram.

## Edge cases

- Identify missing resources, invalid data and relevant failure scenarios.

## Acceptance criteria

- Describe testable outcomes for successful and failing cases.
- Specify how to verify the behavior, including relevant tests.

## Open questions

- Record decisions that need clarification before implementation.
